# Sprint: Fix Catalogue → Products Navigation & Semantic Validation

## Overview
**Goal**: Fix the critical path from catalogue item click → products page to use proper Next.js 15 patterns and add semantic product validation with console logging.

**Current State**: 
- **CRITICAL BUG**: DetailSection.tsx uses `<a>` tag (line 43-51) causing full page reloads
- URLs generated as `/products/headphones/open-back` in data/catalogue.ts
- Products page uses catch-all route `[...category]/page.tsx`
- Semantic validation exists but not integrated into product fetch
- SidebarClient.tsx has hardcoded colors (bg-blue-950)

**Target State**:
- DetailSection uses Next.js `Link` component for client-side navigation
- Semantic validation runs on products fetch with console logging
- Zero regression in existing functionality
- Full adherence to Next.js 15 App Router patterns

---

## End-to-End Critical Path Analysis

### Flow Diagram
```
User Clicks Catalogue Item
    ↓
DetailSection.tsx (HAS BUG: uses <a> not Link)
    ↓
URL: /products/headphones/open-back
    ↓
[...category]/page.tsx (catch-all route)
    ↓
resolveSlugToId("headphones/open-back") → catalogue ID
    ↓
unrollDescendantKeys(id) → all child category IDs
    ↓
getSelectedProducts(catalogueKeys) → products
    ↓
ProductsGrid displays products
```

### Problems Identified

| # | Problem | Location | Impact | Severity |
|---|---------|----------|--------|----------|
| 1 | **Uses `<a>` not `Link`** | DetailSection.tsx:43-51 | Full page reload, state loss | 🔴 CRITICAL |
| 2 | **Semantic validation not integrated** | getSelectedProducts.ts | No validation products match category | 🔴 CRITICAL |
| 3 | **No console logging** | [...category]/page.tsx | Can't verify semantic matches | 🟡 MEDIUM |
| 4 | **Hardcoded colors** | SidebarClient.tsx:18 | Design system violation | 🟡 MEDIUM |
| 5 | **Console.log in production** | getCatalogueData.ts:73 | Data leak in production | 🟡 MEDIUM |

---

## Regression Risk Assessment

**Code Areas at Risk**:
1. `app/components/layout/catalogue/details/DetailSection.tsx` - Navigation fix (HIGH RISK)
2. `sanity/lib/products/getSelectedProducts.ts` - Semantic integration (HIGH RISK)
3. `app/(store)/products/[...category]/page.tsx` - Logging addition (MEDIUM RISK)
4. `app/(store)/products/SidebarClient.tsx` - Color fix (LOW RISK)
5. `data/catalogue.ts` - URL generation (MEDIUM RISK - verify still works)

---

## Scope Contract 1: Fix Navigation (DetailSection.tsx)

**Objective**: Replace `<a>` tag with Next.js `Link` component for client-side navigation.

**Files to Modify**:
- `app/components/layout/catalogue/details/DetailSection.tsx`

**DoD - Layer 1 (Structure)**:
- [ ] Import `Link` from "next/link"
- [ ] Replace `<a>` with `<Link>` component
- [ ] Keep `href={link.url}` prop unchanged
- [ ] Keep all existing className and children

**DoD - Layer 2 (Layout)**:
- [ ] No visual changes to link appearance
- [ ] No changes to hover/active states
- [ ] No changes to animation/transition behavior
- [ ] Staggered animation delays preserved

**DoD - Layer 3 (Surface)**:
- [ ] Typography unchanged (text-body, text-secondary-300)
- [ ] Colors unchanged (hover:text-brand-200, active:text-brand-400)
- [ ] Spacing unchanged (pl-2)
- [ ] Transitions preserved

**DoD - Layer 4 (Interaction)**:
- [ ] Client-side navigation works (no full page reload)
- [ ] Hover states work
- [ ] Active states work
- [ ] Keyboard navigation works
- [ ] Prefetching enabled by default

**Verification (Testing)**:
- [ ] E2E test: Click catalogue item → products page loads via client navigation
- [ ] E2E test: URL changes without page reload (check document.body doesn't flash)
- [ ] E2E test: Back button works correctly
- [ ] E2E test: Hover states still show brand-200 color
- [ ] Manual: Network tab shows no full document requests on navigation

